{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00921","headline":"横吹曲辞 陇头水 一 · 僧皎然","name":"横吹曲辞 陇头水 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇头心欲绝，陇水不堪闻。\n碎影摇枪垒，寒声咽帐军。\n素从盐海积，绿带柳城分。\n日落天边望，逶迤入塞云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}